    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Following a rule-defying pioneer's casting, a fierce social media conflict erupted. Establishment figures leveled charges of cultural sabotage against the production, but advocates defended the move as an inclusive interpretation. The dispute has evolved into a societal debate, with a rebellion against orthodoxy sparking as gatekeepers clash with those demanding collective ownership of Western stories.",
